FL Studio scripting API index (src/fl_mcp/api.json)
  Function names, signatures and constant values extracted from fl-studio-api-stubs
  (https://github.com/MaddyGuthridge/FL-Studio-API-Stubs, LGPL-3.0) by scripts/gen_api_index.py.
  No documentation text or code from the stubs is included. The stubs are a development
  dependency only: the test suite uses them to check that every FL call the controller script
  makes exists with a matching signature.

FL Studio project file format (src/fl_mcp/flp.py)
  The reader/patcher is an original implementation. The event layout it relies on (event ids and
  sizes, note and playlist record layouts) was established by inspecting real project files and
  from the publicly documented structure of the format, and is checked against real FL Studio
  20.8.4 projects. Unknown events are preserved byte for byte, so files written by newer FL
  versions round-trip untouched.
  PyFLP (https://github.com/demberto/PyFLP, GPL-3.0) is used only as an independent cross-check
  in one optional test (tests/oracle_dump.py), run in a separate interpreter through
  FL_MCP_ORACLE_PYTHON. It is not a dependency of the package, is not imported by it and is not
  distributed with it.

Runtime dependencies (installed by pip/uv, not bundled in this repository)
  mcp (MIT), mido (MIT), python-rtmidi (MIT).

